# MathMax Backend — Implementation Plan

## Tech Stack
- **Database:** SQLite via `better-sqlite3` (zero-config, file-based, no external server)
- **Auth:** `bcryptjs` for password hashing + JWT via `jsonwebtoken` for session tokens (stored in HTTP-only cookies)
- **File Uploads:** `multer` (disk storage) → `uploads/` directory in project root
- **API Routes:** Next.js App Router API routes (`app/api/...`)
- **AI Evaluation:** Mock scoring engine (pluggable for real AI later)

## Database Schema

```
users         (id, name, email, password_hash, role, created_at)
subjects      (id, name, color, teacher_id, created_at)
papers        (id, subject_id, title, code, deadline, qp_path, solution_path, created_at)
submissions   (id, paper_id, student_id, file_path, score, feedback, q_breakdown, status, submitted_at, graded_at)
reevaluations (id, submission_id, student_id, question, reason, status, teacher_note, created_at, resolved_at)
```

## API Routes

| Method | Route | Role | Purpose |
|--------|-------|------|---------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | public | Create account |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | public | Sign in → set cookie |
| POST | `/api/auth/logout` | any | Clear cookie |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | any | Get current user from cookie |
| GET | `/api/subjects` | teacher | List teacher's subjects |
| POST | `/api/subjects` | teacher | Create subject |
| DELETE | `/api/subjects/[id]` | teacher | Delete subject |
| GET | `/api/papers?subjectId=X` | teacher | List papers for a subject |
| POST | `/api/papers` | teacher | Create paper + upload QP file |
| GET | `/api/papers/lookup?code=X` | student | Lookup paper by QP code |
| GET | `/api/papers/deadlines` | student | Student's available papers |
| GET | `/api/submissions?paperId=X` | teacher | All submissions for a paper |
| POST | `/api/submissions` | student | Upload answer sheet |
| GET | `/api/submissions/[id]` | any | Single submission detail |
| PATCH | `/api/submissions/[id]/marks` | teacher | Override AI marks |
| GET | `/api/results` | student | Student's graded results |
| GET | `/api/results/stats` | student | Aggregate stats for home |
| GET | `/api/analytics?paperId=X` | teacher | Analytics for a paper |
| GET | `/api/reevaluations` | teacher | All reeval requests |
| POST | `/api/reevaluations` | student | Request re-evaluation |
| PATCH | `/api/reevaluations/[id]` | teacher | Approve/reject |
| GET | `/api/export/csv?paperId=X` | teacher | Download CSV |

## Build Order
1. Dependencies + DB init script
2. Auth middleware + API routes
3. Subjects + Papers CRUD
4. File upload (QP + answer sheets)
5. Mock AI grading engine
6. Submissions + Results
7. Re-evaluation flow
8. Analytics + Export
9. Wire all frontend components to real API
10. Auth guards on pages

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Every frontend component currently imports from `mockData.js`. The migration strategy is:
> create `app/lib/api.js` with fetch helpers, then update each component one by one.
